== src/vue/Search.pick
EventEntry — Vue calls this when the template raises 'click'
Emit — raise 'pick' to the parent component with item
== src/vue/Search.(module).watch query
EventEntry — Vue runs this when query changes
Branch — if next.length > 20
  true:
    SetMember — set query.value to next.slice(0, 20)
  false:
== src/vue/Search.(module).onMounted
EventEntry — Vue calls this after the component is added to the page
SetMember — set query.value to new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("q") ?? ""
== src/vue/Search.(module)
EventEntry — Vue runs this setup once for every instance of the component
Var — props = the props the parent component passes
Var — emit = the events this component can raise to its parent
Var — query = reactive value, starts as "" (read and write query.value)
Var — matches = computed value, recalculated when what it reads changes
Subscribe — when query changes, run watch query
Subscribe — after the component is added to the page, run onMounted
